# Results with nobody "you", offline: the debug match with four CPUs (Link,
# Mario, Fox and DK, one stock each) on Poke Floats, where all but one fall
# out within half a minute, often several on one frame. The CPUs fight on their
# own, so who wins and the numbers vary from run to run, and ties for a
# place are common. The opening names the winner and all four by place
# with no "you"; controller 1, plugged into P1's CPU port, opens the stats
# panels and pages P1's panel, the one the reading cursor follows, starting
# on P1. The cursor steps, switches over all four players and their edges,
# says Z's line, and pages each way. With no human, Start from controller 1
# leaves results, and the debug match starts again.
# Run from Git Bash with the debug match switches:
#   MELEE_DEBUG_VS=cpu4 MELEE_DEBUG_VS_STOCKS=1 MELEE_DEBUG_VS_STAGE=23 \
#     python tools/a11y/drive.py tools/a11y/results_cpu4.drive
# run_level.py fails it on any line saying "you", in your voice, or a ready.

# Start on the title screen goes straight into the debug match, which the
# CPUs end on their own. With nobody "you", every match announcement is in
# the opponents' voice, labelled by slot ("CPU 2 13"), and none in yours.
wait "state 0 scene 0$"
press Start until "boot scene: state \d+ scene 2$"
wait 'voice opponents \(off\): "CPU [1-4] \d+"$' 60
wait '"Stock Battle\. Winner: (?P<winner>Link|Mario|Fox|DK)\. 1st (?P=winner), P[1-4], [^."]+\.( (1st|2nd|3rd|4th) (Link|Mario|Fox|DK), P[1-4], [^."]+\.){3} Any button shows the stats\. Start when ready\."$' 120

# Controller 1's press opens the panels, on P1's.
press DUp
wait '"KOs and falls\. KOs\. A and B change page\. D-pad up and down read the rows, left and right switch player\. Z the player.s summary\. Start when ready\."$'

# P1's rows, then each player to the right: Mario's second row is P3 Fox
# as P1's is, Fox's P2 Mario, DK's P2 Mario as Fox's; DK at the edge.
press DDown
wait '"P2 Mario, \d+"$'
press DDown
wait '"P3 Fox, \d+"$'
press DRight
wait '"Mario, P2, \d+"$'
press DRight
wait '"Fox, P3, P2 Mario, \d+"$'
press DRight
wait '"DK, P4, \d+"$'
press DRight
wait '"DK, P4"$'
press Z
wait '"DK, P4, (1st|2nd|3rd|4th), \d+ KOs?, \d+ falls?, \d+ SDs?, (not KO.d|KO.d at \d+:\d\d)\."$'

# Back to P1, its edge without "you".
press DLeft
wait '"Fox, P3, \d+"$'
press DLeft
wait '"Mario, P2, P3 Fox, \d+"$'
press DLeft
wait '"Link, P1, \d+"$'
press DLeft
wait '"Link, P1"$'

# A pages P1's panel forward; A on Bonuses, the last page, is silent.
press A
wait '"Stats\. KOs, \d+\."$'
press A
wait '"Bonuses\. ([^"]+, -?\d+|No bonuses)\."$'
press A
sleep 0.5
press B
wait '"Stats\. KOs, \d+\."$'
press Z
wait '"Link, P1, (1st|2nd|3rd|4th), \d+ KOs?, \d+ falls?, \d+ SDs?, (not KO.d|KO.d at \d+:\d\d)\."$'

press Start
wait 'boot scene: state \d+ scene 2$'
